    {
      "source": "For example, the URL <code>http://localhost/test/this</code> would use\n<code>\"\"</code> as the context path.",
      "translation": "例如，URL `<code>http://localhost/test/this</code>` 会使用`<code>\"\"</code>`作为上下文路径。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The path may be <code>null</code> in which case the first path segment\nof the URL is turned into the contextPath. Otherwise it must conform\nto <code>HttpServletRequest.getContextPath()</code>\nwhich states that it can be an empty string and otherwise must start\nwith a \"/\" character and not end with a \"/\" character.",
      "translation": "该路径可能为 `<code>null</code>`，此时 URL 的第一个路径段将被转换为 contextPath。否则，它必须符合 `<code>HttpServletRequest.getContextPath()</code>` 的规定，即它可以是一个空字符串，否则必须以 \"/\" 字符开头且不能以 \"/\" 字符结尾。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This is the core integration with <a href=\"https://htmlunit.sourceforge.io/\">HtmlUnit</a>.",
      "translation": "这是与<a href=\"https://htmlunit.sourceforge.io/\">HtmlUnit</a>的核心集成。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Example usage can be seen below.",
      "translation": "示例用法如下所示。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>webClient</code> - the <code>WebClient</code> to use. never <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>webClient</code> - 要使用的 <code>WebClient</code>，永远不为 <code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mockMvc</code> - the <code>MockMvc</code> instance to use (never <code>null</code>)",
