      "translation": "<code>webClient</code> - 要使用的 <code>WebClient</code>（绝不能为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>contextPath</code> - the contextPath to use",
      "translation": "<code>contextPath</code> - 要使用的上下文路径",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance that assumes the context path of the application\nis <code>\"\"</code> (i.e., the root context).",
      "translation": "创建一个新实例，假设应用程序的上下文路径为 `<code>\"\"</code>`（即根上下文）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
